    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们的好日子还在后头~</span></p><p><span>- </span></p><p><span>嘉宾：韭菜</span></p><p><span>-</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 30岁生日那天做了什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 还记得15岁时对“30岁的自己”的想象吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> 活到现在最遗憾的事情是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a> 30岁到来后、有哪些震撼发现？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> 30岁相比于18岁的好处是什么？坏处呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 最近一次很有成就感的事情是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a> 最近一次对自己说“不要再这样了”是什么事情？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">30:22</a> 如果对20岁的自己说一句话、你会说什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 如果问40岁的自己一个问题、你会问什么？</span></p><p><span>-</span><br><span>BGM: 《知己》-音乐剧《风声》</span></p><p><span>-</span><br><span>相关单集：</span></p><p><span>【WP002】我看世界 | 听了一段男人们的对话 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62647f343db96e05d876f7bc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62647f343db96e05d876f7bc"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>047. 世界慌张、笑声嘹亮 -《一年一度喜剧大赛》羡慕安利（上）</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667c2eb0c13b46d76c18c40c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667c2eb0c13b46d76c18c40c"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>048. 世界慌张、笑声嘹亮 – 《一年一度喜剧大赛》羡慕安利（下）</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6685362a0bc5d7cc708f21e4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6685362a0bc5d7cc708f21e4"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>049. 有情有趣、无害无惧——上海2024API生活展见闻 </span><a href="https://youtu.be/S2VLh8N3Ogk" data-url="https://youtu.be/S2VLh8N3Ogk"><span>youtu.be</span></a></p><p><span>096. 主理一个家-主播韭菜的装修分享 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69905c30a22480add6225fdf" data-ur