    <title>099. 女性雄竞学文本分析-曲曲和谢胜子让谁着迷？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c51ae8852cf1b8bb032f0d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c51ae8852cf1b8bb032f0d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Apr 2026 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这个世界亏欠了女人太多成功。</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>本期嘉宾：五花肉</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:00:13</a> 曲曲和谢胜子的身价成了这个时代女性焦虑的水位线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">00:09:31</a> 雄竞和雌竞的定义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">00:14:27</a> 我们眼中的曲曲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">00:17:55</a> 我们眼中的谢胜子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">00:24:19</a> “曲曲”和“谢胜子”两个品牌的相似性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1579">00:26:19</a> “曲曲”和“谢胜子”两个品牌的不同之处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2028">00:33:48</a> 她们贩卖的是什么情绪价值</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2374">00:39:34</a> 喜欢曲曲和谢胜子的女人是什么样的女人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2923">00:48:43</a> 不喜欢曲曲和谢胜子的女人是什么样的女人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3257">00:54:17</a> 不要用贬低雌竞来诱惑女人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3642">01:00:42</a> 竞来竞去、到底什么时候是个头？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4715">01:18:35</a> 拒绝咨询博主的女人在想什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5418">01:30:18</a> 我们推荐的雄竞和雌竞的方式</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>参考书目：</span></p><p><span>《萨德式女人》安吉拉·卡特</span></p><p><span>《家庭、私有制与国家的起源》弗里德里希·恩格斯</span></p><p><span>《逃避自由》艾里希·弗洛姆</span></p><p><span>《女太监》杰梅茵·格里尔</span></p><p><span>《我和我不为人知的“瘾”》侯小圣</span></p><p><span>《疼痛的形状：女性创伤修复实录》侯小圣</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>BGM:</span></p><p><span>Pink Horizon - Chris Haugen</span></p>]]></description>
