    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>老年、一个需要被废弃的概念。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 《日落时分说爱你》老年恋综还是成了奇观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> 谁在害怕老年人的情与欲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="704">11:44</a> 老年状态的强外部性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1451">24:11</a> 爱与自由都不好使</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">29:29</a> 膜拜“成功”的老年背后是年轻人的恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">31:19</a> 性别-年龄双歧视结构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2047">34:07</a> 关于超越老年的想象</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span>播客节目：064. 阿姨也被狠狠宠？短剧里的《羞耻感与老年女性》</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6773f7e51e823e72d343a89b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6773f7e51e823e72d343a89b"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span><br><span></span></a><span>015. 新时代无产者的悲歌—《工作、消费主义和新穷人》</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62ce2ff192f0689a31f4ffe4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62ce2ff192f0689a31f4ffe4"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span><br><span></span></a><span>071. 打工漫谈2： 年纪轻轻就工作倦怠了怎么办？ </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e12c9f78103db3bd92e726" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e12c9f78103db3bd92e726"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span><br><span></span></a><span>091. 值钱的善念-什么是《国家的真正财富》？</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69384fa33fec3166cf2a8e4a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69384fa33fec3166cf2a8e4a"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span><br><span></span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>书影音：《老年》西蒙娜·德·波伏娃</span><br><span>《羞耻感与老年女性》J·布鲁克斯·布森</span><br><span>《日落时分说爱你》</span><br><span>《暮色将尽》戴安娜·阿西尔</span><br><span