  <item>
    <title>096. 主理一个家-主播韭菜的装修分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69905c30a22480add6225fdf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69905c30a22480add6225fdf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>恭喜发财！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：韭菜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loIqaAKvv6J-rX-atuJS083IQhP_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 装修整体回顾：时间&amp;钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> 买房：没有最好的时机、只有最强的意愿</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>千头万绪的装修故事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 如何挑选装修公司</span></p><span></span><p><span>设计费的收取标准</span></p><span></span><p><span>有无远程施工费</span></p><span></span><p><span>警惕“工艺升级”</span></p><span></span><p><span>全包和半包的区别</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjVRT7bKa6rcNFfGE-OvtB4BtuU5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>付款周期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> 硬装的大决策</span></p><span></span><p><span>户型改造、墙体改造、水电改造、吊顶设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">44:12</a> 软装风格定义</span></p><span></span><p><span>靠自己&amp;靠橙子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2832">47:12</a> 功能性家电/物品（床柜子沙发等）的选择思路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3147">52:27</a> 花最多钱但是外人看不太出来的项目是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>瓷洁墙漆 &amp; 墙面处理费</span></p><span></span><p><span>注意防蓝光眼镜带来的色差啊大家！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3451">57:31</a> 花小钱（100以内）给你带来最多享受感的是家里哪些东西？</span></p><span></span><p><span>房本工本费 &amp; 黄铜复古拨杆开光 &amp; 漂亮的装饰品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3512">58:32</a> 花最多心思但是外人看不太出来的项目是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>全屋定制</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5034">01:23:54</a> 哪些东西是你不太在意的（看得过眼就不管了）？吊顶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5064">01:24:24</a> 咱也是走进新时代了、家里有哪些智能懒人好物？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>社会化实践课堂：成熟又从容的韭菜啊、敬你！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5200">01:26:40</a> 推销电话有哪怕一点用吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5255">01:27:35</a> 短时间做重大决策所带来的焦虑感如何缓解？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5880">01:38:00</a> 实装不符合要求、要求返工时会不会不好意思？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6545">01:49:05</a> 这一轮装修结束、你最想分享给大家的三条经验是？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>不着急付全款、认真看合同、适量刷帖</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6798">01:53:18</a> 现在这是你梦想中的生活吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>声音room tour &amp; 想到哪儿说哪儿的经历分享</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6888">1:54:48</a> 设备间：扫地机器人、灭火器、智能门锁、钢琴键衣帽架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7373">2:02:53</a> 地砖的选择：简素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7637">2:07:17</a> 餐厅：藤编元素桌椅、坐垫、装饰相关、灯具选择相关、餐边柜、轨道插座的疑惑、微波炉方面等等党的失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8511">2:21:51</a> 厨房：凉霸、洗碗机、大单槽、吸油烟机、</span><strong><span>手工小砖</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9335">2:35:35</a> 客厅：边几、绿植、电动沙发、地毯、双层纱帘、</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9867">02:44:27</a> 次卫：玻璃半墙、窄边收纳、洗烘套装、各种胶、</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10404">2:53:24</a> 多功能间：貌美斗柜、人体工学椅、掉渣窗帘、戴森吸尘器、开荒保洁、囤货区、门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11362">3:09:22</a> 主卧：玻璃灯、电动窗帘开关、床</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11857">3:17:37</a> 主卫：瓷砖变色的秘密、卫生巾花车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11944">3:19:04</a> 次卧：一切从简</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>111件装修小清单：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs__i6CpYnRQdZN9lV-tVz-l5eG4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuut4c4wO3ejVzOv0ye4MQMdVIpM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm:</span></p><span></span><p><span>《恭喜发财》祝所有女孩~明天呀我们更厉害 - bilibili：</span><strong><span>牛仔竞技场的甜心 &amp; 苏苏苏苏醒啦 &amp; 米酒好喝爱喝多喝 &amp; 偶遇没有中二病</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>来源：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MZz8BYEGW/?spm_id_from=333.1387.top_right_bar_window_history.content.click&amp;vd_source=d6f1f94d997bdc1a6e1d89cea13c3f47" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MZz8BYEGW/?spm_id_from=333.1387.top_right_bar_window_history.content.click&amp;vd_source=d6f1f94d997bdc1a6e1d89cea13c3f47"><span>《恭喜发财》祝所有女孩~明天呀我们更厉害_哔哩哔哩_bilibili</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>感谢授权</span></p>]]></description>
