    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为何《她的病痛、总被当作幻觉》？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：五花肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 姐妹骂爹半生、归来还是被厌女医疗制震撼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 静音恢复1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> 我们经历过的失败的诊疗经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> 静音恢复2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> 我们也曾把其他女人的病痛当作幻觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 静音恢复3</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> 话说回来、女人的感觉是否真得可靠？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2894">48:14</a> 你的身体、处于谁的控制之下？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3557">59:17</a> 静音恢复4</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3577">59:37</a> 自我剥削是交易还是幻觉？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3832">1:03:52</a> 静音恢复5</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4272">1:11:12</a> 静音恢复6</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4350">1:12:30</a> 静音恢复7</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4352">01:12:32</a> 月经——伟大的洁净的潮汐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4374">01:12:54</a> 静音恢复8</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>纸质书：<a data-url="http://dmll.cn/5QgG" href="http://dmll.cn/5QgG">dmll.cn</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关单集：</span></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span>012. 《身体由我》，吗？关于“自由”的身体经验 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62b5e14a2af904c4f00314f2" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62b5e14a2af904c4f00314f2"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>015. 新时代无产者的悲歌—《工作、消费主义和新穷人》 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62ce2ff192f0689a31f4ffe4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62ce2ff192f0689a31f4ffe4"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>073. 不服“美役”随便你、不服“审美役”就太无趣 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680e05537a449ae858fca7b2" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680e05537a449ae858fca7b2"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>081. 回归《完整的女人》-与自身合作 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6890a6cc8e06fe8de7470384" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6890a6cc8e06fe8de7470384"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>084. 撕开《黄色墙纸》、面前仍是迷雾 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a5a93e42cc2798e78a0d73" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a5a93e42cc2798e78a0d73"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></li><span></span></ol><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>《曾经我也想过一了百了》-中岛美嘉（听力恢复后初现场）</span></p>]]></description>
