    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Jan 2026 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：韭菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> 去年立下的攒钱flag达成了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 2025全年收入分配情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 哪些应该削减预算？哪些又想增加呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1147">19:07</a> 平心而论、你喜欢钱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 攒钱技巧还有新招！</span></p><span></span><p><span>淘金币大额减免</span></p><span></span><p><span>fake是我的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 2025好物榜 &amp; 垃圾榜</span></p><span></span><p><span>好物：电动螺丝套组 &amp; 除螨仪 &amp; 临期护肤品 &amp; 防撞硅胶软贴 &amp; 激光冲印 &amp; 电动沙发 &amp; 追星</span></p><span></span><p><span>垃圾：多余的墙漆 &amp; 货不对版的衣服 &amp; 决策问题 &amp; 冰点脱毛仪 &amp; 猪头损失 &amp; 上海诈骗饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3491">58:11</a> 账户里多点小钱能带来多少幸福感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3992">01:06:32</a> 2026的攒钱口号</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>往年攒钱回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span>2023</span></p><span></span><p><span>034. 钱从四面八方来、也向五湖四海去—我和韭菜的攒钱实操</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6528158019dde7bf6a5cf1e0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6528158019dde7bf6a5cf1e0"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>2024</span></p><span></span><p><span>058. 要有多少钱我们才能不痛苦？2024吃好玩好的攒钱汇报</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671b96eaeb46cd6655b7afd5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671b96eaeb46cd6655b7afd5"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Everglow - Patrick Patrikios</span></p>]]></description>
