  <item>
    <title>093. 晋江文学才是小说妹的原生家庭</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695aca279b7892496e96ab76</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695aca279b7892496e96ab76</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Jan 2026 22:16:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：五花肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关文本：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《脂粉帝国》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《幸福婚姻与性》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《傲慢与偏见》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《真爱假说》</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 专注小言之“小”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小言男主的经典设定</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">06:14</a> 高富帅男主必有裂缝、真爱的光才能照进来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">12:51</a> 安全感是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 谁在哄抬“长子”的价值？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> 小言的世界里、爱情是无坚不摧的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>经典桥段</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 霸总爱上小白花、除了“见色起意”还有什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 你是我的药、“看见”被设定消解了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2109">35:09</a> 追妻火葬场、押宝小说男主和炒股是一个意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2506">41:46</a> “光希不能捐”背后的育力恐怖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2631">43:51</a> 女强男更强、可以想象女人独自面对世界的样子吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2989">49:49</a> 恶婆婆、恶女二和完美男二、工具人背后是作者的无能</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>非经典组成部分</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">51:25</a> 消解傲慢、打破偏见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3216">53:36</a> 夫妻同心拯救世界</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3290">54:50</a> 最爱的言情小说大公开</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>五花肉：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《怨气撞铃》尾鱼-权衡之后仍有爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>《凤倾天阑》天下归元 - 真心理解</span></p><span></span><p><span>《骄阳似我》顾漫 - 自我成长</span></p><span></span><p><span>《泡沫之夏》明晓溪 - 个性迷人</span></p><span></span><p><span>粒粒：</span></p><span></span><p><span>满座衣冠胜雪 - 不必强也有魅力、有人性的男主角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4814">1:20:14</a> “被选中”理想-自我确认</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5067">1:24:27</a> 吃下自我确认感的代餐后、还有什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5865">1:37:45</a> 言情文的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6022">1:40:22</a> 没有信念就没有童话</span></p><span></span><p><span>希行《诛砂》《娇娘医经》《名门医女》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6607">1:50:07</a> 《真爱假说》-一辆大大的倒车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6973">1:56:13</a> 退一万步、晋江永远胜过老登文学</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tears - Sabrina Carpenter</span></p><span></span><p><span>Spanish Rose - Chris Haugen</span></p>]]></description>
