    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>女人在文学的世界里过着一种次要生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>男人在爱什么“爱”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> 社交媒体only的深情slogan</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 作者的偏心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 到底什么是“深情”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> 生活非生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">23:01</a> 懦弱的爱——美女信仰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">27:38</a> 天真的日子何时结束？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2149">35:49</a> 男人如何才能逃开“长子”的束缚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3445">57:25</a> 女人的自决</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3999">01:06:39</a> 何为真正的生活？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4352">01:12:32</a> 男作家往往疼爱他们的男主角、女作家往往折磨她们的女主角</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考书影音：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《面纱》《霍乱时期的爱情》《龙族》《女太监》《小时代》《脂粉帝国》《幸福婚姻与性》</span></p>]]></description>
